3) Fitting linear regression algorithm in train (for more examples -[scikit-linear reg](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/auto_examples/linear_model/plot_ols.html#sphx-glr-auto-examples-linear-model-plot-ols-py>)
4) Evaluating algorithm in both train and test sets (compare predictions to true labels through metric RMSE) -[scikit-RMSE](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/auto_examples/linear_model/plot_ols.html#sphx-glr-auto-examples-linear-model-plot-ols-py)

As an extra:

5) What happens if now we have a very different dataset? (pandemic has happened and we now have much younger patients coming in). The model no longer holds and we can detect it by comparing the evaluation metrics. 


